  ('0311c746-daae-4597-880f-0c8e6ad5563f'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000307'::uuid, 'OH', 'medicaid_mco', '99347', 'modifier_required', '{"answer":"(1) High-value rule for home-based palliative practices, where nurse practitioners deliver most visits. EVERY service billed for an APN must carry the modifier denoting the type of APN who rendered it - not just selected services. Reimbursement follows OAC 5160-4-04 (APRN Services). Mapped by service (''any service provided by an APN'' is unqualified, so it reaches home-visit E/M, ACP, prolonged services, TCM, CCM and unlisted E/M); the document names no codes and does not specify which modifier maps to which APN type - consult the ODM Modifiers document referenced by the manual. (2) Where Molina Medicaid is the primary payer, telehealth claims for these services must carry the GT modifier (plus any other appropriate modifiers). The same sentence governs place of service - see the paired pos_allowed rule. Mapped by service (all telehealth claims); no codes named. Community behavioural health providers follow separate ODM BH manual guidance. (3) General requirement that every telehealth claim carry the correct codes and appropriate modifiers for the plan type and service, with CMS and ODM telehealth billing guidelines controlling the specifics (OAC 5160-1-18). Mapped by service (all telehealth claims); no codes named. Use with the GT-modifier rule above.","appliesToService":"any service provided by an APN [Advanced Practice Nurse]","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code","sourceDocument":"Molina Healthcare of Ohio Medicaid — Provider Manual + Addendum (July 1, 2025)","supportingQuotes":[{"label":"telehealth Claims - Guidance for Medicaid as Primary Payer","quote":"Guidance for Medicaid as Primary Payer: The GT modifier, and any other appropriate modifiers, should be included on all telehealth Claims, and the POS should accurately reflect the physical location of the practitioner*.","document":"Molina Healthcare of Ohio Medicaid — Provider Manual + Addendum (July 1, 2025)"},{"label":"All telehealth Claims for Molina Members","quote":"All telehealth Claims for Molina Members must be submitted to Molina with correct codes and appropriate modifiers for the plan type and service.","document":"Molina Healthcare of Ohio Medicaid — Provider Manual + Addendum (July 1, 2025)"}]}'::jsonb, 'unknown', 0.75, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'f1000000-0001-4000-8000-00000000a001'::uuid, 'When billing for any service provided by an APN, all services must be billed with the appropriate modifier to denote the type of APN that provided the service.', 'extract:round3-six-payers-2026-08'),
