Asynchronous store-and-forward delivery of any of these services must be accompanied by an in-person office visit to determine diagnosis or treatment - store-and-forward alone will not support the encounter. Mapped by service (Covered Services delivered by store-and-forward); no codes named.","appliesToService":"health care services identified in Appendix A of OAC 5160-1-18 Telehealth when delivered through the use of telehealth from the practitioner site","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code","sourceDocument":"Molina Healthcare of Ohio Medicaid — Provider Manual + Addendum (July 1, 2025)","supportingQuotes":[{"label":"Telehealth and Telemedicine Services","quote":"Services are a method of accessing Covered Services and not a separate benefit.","document":"Molina Healthcare of Ohio Medicaid — Provider Manual + Addendum (July 1, 2025)"},{"label":"Covered Services from participating Providers through the use of Telehealth and Telemedicine services","quote":"Molina Members may obtain Covered Services from participating Providers through the use of Telehealth and Telemedicine services.","document":"Molina Healthcare of Ohio Medicaid — Provider Manual + Addendum (July 1, 2025)"},{"label":"Telehealth and Telemedicine Services","quote":"Services are not permitted when the Member and participating Provider are in the same physical location.","document":"Molina Healthcare of Ohio Medicaid — Provider Manual + Addendum (July 1, 2025)"},{"label":"Covered Services provided through store-and-forward technology","quote":"Covered Services provided through store-and-forward technology must include an in-person office visit to determine diagnosis or treatment.","document":"Molina Healthcare of Ohio Medicaid — Provider Manual + Addendum (July 1, 2025)"}]}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.75, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'f1000000-0001-4000-8000-00000000a001'::uuid, 'Payment may be made only for Medically Necessary health care services identified in Appendix A of OAC 5160-1-18 Telehealth when delivered through the use of telehealth from the practitioner site.', 'extract:round3-six-payers-2026-08'),
