th when delivered through the use of telehealth from the practitioner site.', 'extract:round3-six-payers-2026-08'),
  ('e3076164-5b59-42c2-8a4c-100f6682c32a'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000205'::uuid, 'SC', 'medicaid_mco', '99341', 'prior_auth_required', '{"answer":"(1) No retroactive authorization: Molina will not authorize a service after the fact when that service required prior authorization. Authorization must be in hand before the visit is rendered. Post-service review is only considered where the provider did not know and could not reasonably have known the patient was a Molina member, or where Molina erred. (2) Blanket payment consequence: if a service on Molina''s PA list is performed without authorization it may not be paid. Emergency services are excluded from the PA requirement, and obtaining authorization does not itself guarantee payment. Scope: applies to any in-scope code whenever a PA requirement attaches (e.g. non-par provider, unlisted code). (3) Same blanket out-of-network rule stated in the handbook: ALL care by a non-contracted, non-network provider must be prior authorized (emergency services excepted). Applies to every in-scope code when the rendering/billing provider is not contracted with Molina SC.","appliesToService":"Services that require prior authorization","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code","sourceDocument":"Molina Healthcare of South Carolina — 2026 Medicaid Provider Manual","supportingQuotes":[{"label":"Services that require prior authorization","quote":"Services performed without authorization may not be eligible for payment.","document":"Molina Healthcare of South Carolina — 2026 Medicaid Provider Manual"},{"label":"Out of network providers and services","quote":"If there is a need to go to a non-contracted Provider, all care provided by non-contracted, non-network Providers must be prior authorized by Molina.","document":"Molina Healthcare of South Carolina — 2026 Medicaid Provider Manual"}]}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.75, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'f1000000-0004-4000-8000-00000000a004'::uuid, 'Molina does not retroactively authorize services that require prior authorization.', 'extract:round3-six-payers-2026-08'),
