 related to the requested services.","document":"Molina Healthcare of South Carolina Medicaid — Pre-Service Review Guide, effective 02/01/2026"},{"label":"For a complete and accurate medical record, all Provider documentation must","quote":"Have the Provider''s signature and credentials.","document":"Molina Healthcare of South Carolina — 2026 Medicaid Provider Manual"},{"label":"For a complete and accurate medical record, all Provider documentation must","quote":"Contain a treatment plan and progress notes.","document":"Molina Healthcare of South Carolina — 2026 Medicaid Provider Manual"}]}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.75, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'f1000000-0004-4000-8000-00000000a004'::uuid, 'Clinical information sufficient to document the medical necessity of the requested service', 'extract:round3-six-payers-2026-08'),
