icaid Provider Manual"}]}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.75, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'f1000000-0004-4000-8000-00000000a004'::uuid, 'This includes services provided by a Physician or nurse practitioner or Rural Health Clinic', 'extract:round3-six-payers-2026-08'),
